    "Agent 等你在电脑上操作时，做完点底栏的「我完成了」，它就接着做。直接关掉画面也算交还。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When an agent is waiting for you to do something on the computer, tap “I'm Done” in the bottom bar when you're finished and it carries on. Closing the screen also hands it back."
