    "ego lite 里还没有登录过的网站。导入另一台电脑或浏览器导出的 cookie 文件，助手就能用你的登录打开那些网站。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No sites are signed in to ego lite yet. Import a cookie file exported from another computer or browser, and the assistant can open those sites as you."
          }
