    "hub 还没接飞书：在 hub 所在的机器上运行飞书网关，并在 hub.json 的 lark 里填上它（docs/feishu.md）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The hub isn't connected to Lark yet: run the Lark gateway on the hub machine and add it under lark in hub.json (docs/feishu.md)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ハブはまだLarkに接続されていません。ハブのマシンでLarkゲートウェイを実行し、hub.jsonのlarkに設定してください（docs/feishu.md）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "hub 还没接飞书：在 hub 所在的机器上运行飞书网关，并在 hub.json 的 lark 里填上它（docs/feishu.md）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "hub 连上后，这里会显示 hub 所在的机器和它接入的各台电脑。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once the hub is connected, the hub machine and the computers it connects to appear here."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
