    "关掉 ego 的使用统计：在那台 Mac 的 ego lite 里打开「设置 › 同步和服务」，关掉「Automatically sends usage statistics and crash reports to Citro Labs」": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn off ego's usage statistics: in ego lite on that Mac, open Settings › Sync and services and turn off “Automatically sends usage statistics and crash reports to Citro Labs”"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "egoの使用統計をオフにします：そのMacのego liteで「設定 › 同期とサービス」を開き、「Automatically sends usage statistics and crash reports to Citro Labs」をオフにします"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关掉 ego 的使用统计：在那台 Mac 的 ego lite 里打开「设置 › 同步和服务」，关掉「Automatically sends usage statistics and crash reports to Citro Labs」"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关掉后 %@ 停下来；登录状态留着。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When it's off, %@ stops. Your sign-in is kept."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "オフにすると%@は停止します。ログイン状態は残ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关掉后 %@ 停下来；登录状态留着。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关掉后不再读 %@；登录状态和已经存下的数据都留着。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When it's off, %@ is no longer read. Your sign-in and the data already saved are kept."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "オフにすると%@の読み込みを停止します。ログイン状態と保存済みのデータは残ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关掉后不再读 %@；登录状态和已经存下的数据都留着。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关掉后它不再把消息交给 Persona；绑定和设置留着。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When off, it stops passing messages to Persona; the binding and settings stay."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "オフにするとPersonaにメッセージを渡さなくなります。紐づけと設定は残ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关掉后它不再把消息交给 Persona；绑定和设置留着。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关掉后，这次改的内容不会保存。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you close it, the changes you made won't be saved."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "閉じると、今回の変更は保存されません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关掉后，这次改的内容不会保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关掉失败：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't turn off: %@"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "オフにできませんでした：%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关掉失败：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关着时锁屏只显示数量和「有个授权等你」，不显示 Agent 名字和内容": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When off, the Lock Screen shows only counts and “A permission is waiting”, not agent names or content"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "オフのとき、ロック画面には件数と「許可を待っています」だけを表示し、エージェント名や内容は表示しません"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关着时锁屏只显示数量和「有个授权等你」，不显示 Agent 名字和内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关着：有新版本时只在扩展的页面里提示，你自己去升级。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off: new versions are only shown on the extension's page, and you update it yourself."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "オフ：新しいバージョンは拡張機能のページに表示されるだけで、アップデートは自分で行います。"
