    "关闭时先直连 hub，连不上才走 SSH 隧道。iPhone 回到前台时隧道会重新建立。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When off, the app connects to the hub directly first and only uses the SSH tunnel if that fails. The tunnel is rebuilt when the iPhone app returns to the foreground."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "オフのときはまずハブに直接接続し、つながらない場合だけSSHトンネルを使います。iPhoneでアプリがフォアグラウンドに戻るとトンネルを再確立します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭时先直连 hub，连不上才走 SSH 隧道。iPhone 回到前台时隧道会重新建立。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
