            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在飞书中打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在飞书任何地方以 /agent 开头说一句，就起一个 Agent 处理并替你回复": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start a message with /agent anywhere in Lark to have an agent handle it and reply for you"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Larkのどこでも/agentで始めて送ると、エージェントが処理して代わりに返信します"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在飞书任何地方以 /agent 开头说一句，就起一个 Agent 处理并替你回复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在飞书开放平台建一个企业自建应用，开启「机器人」能力": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Create a custom app on the Lark Open Platform and enable the Bot capability"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
