    "密钥加密存在 hub 上，只交给这个扩展；存好后不再显示，只能换新的或清除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secrets are stored encrypted on the hub and given only to this extension. Once saved they aren't shown again; you can only replace or clear them."
