    "这台 Mac 上 ego lite 的所有 cookie 都会删掉，所有网站都要重新登录。你自己在 ego 里的登录也一样。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All of ego lite's cookies on this Mac will be deleted, and every site will need you to sign in again. This includes your own sign-ins in ego."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このMacのego liteのCookieがすべて削除され、すべてのサイトで再ログインが必要になります。ego上でのご自身のログインも同様です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 上 ego lite 的所有 cookie 都会删掉，所有网站都要重新登录。你自己在 ego 里的登录也一样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这台 Mac 上还没有装 Cua Driver": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cua Driver isn't installed on this Mac yet"
