    "，": {
      "comment": "List separator\nSeparator between items in a list\nSeparator between items of a spoken list\nSeparator between mail recipients\nSeparator between parts of an accessibility label\nSeparator between sessions in the unread list\nSeparator between the lines of a spoken summary\nSeparator between the parts of a VoiceOver label",
